{"pin":"BH08855","subcodes":[{"code":"BH08855","anchor":"","first_line":"Lauded be Thy name, O my God and the God of all things, my Glory and the Glory of all things","first_line_orig":"سبحانک یا الهی و اله کلشیء و بهائی و بهاء کل شیء و رجائی و رجاء کلشیء و  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"110","full_text_parts":["Lauded be Thy name, O my God and the God of all things, my Glory and the Glory of all things, my Desire and the Desire of all things, my Strength and the Strength of all things, my King and the King of all things, my Aim and the Aim of all things, my Mover and the Mover of all things!  Suffer me not, I implore Thee, to be kept back from the ocean of Thy tender mercies, nor to be far removed from the shores of nearness to Thee.\nAught else except Thee, O my Lord, profiteth me not, and near access to anyone save Thyself availeth me nothing.  I entreat Thee by the plenteousness of Thy riches, whereby Thou didst dispense with all else except Thyself, to number me with such as have set their faces towards Thee, and arisen to serve Thee.\nForgive, then, O my Lord, Thy servants and Thy handmaidens.  Thou, truly, art the Ever-Forgiving, the Most","Thou, truly, art the Ever-Forgiving, the Most Compassionate."],"translations":[{"language":"ml","lang_name":"Malayalam"},{"language":"ru","lang_name":"Russian"},{"language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"language":"bs","lang_name":"Bosnian"},{"language":"hi","lang_name":"Hindi"},{"language":"et","lang_name":"Estonian"},{"language":"ro","lang_name":"Romanian"},{"language":"id","lang_name":"Indonesian"},{"language":"lg","lang_name":"Ganda"},{"language":"sv","lang_name":"Swedish"},{"language":"tl","lang_name":"Tagalog"},{"language":"uk","lang_name":"Ukrainian"},{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"hy","lang_name":"Armenian"},{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"mn","lang_name":"Mongolian"},{"language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"language":"da","lang_name":"Danish"},{"language":"fr","lang_